<Base title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    <i>Invisible Hand</i> (working title) is a short non-narrative film about my job as an invisible editor:
    how audience negativity shapes my cuts, and what happens when I automate myself. It draws on Kuleshov,
    Vertov and Farocki.
  </p>
  <p>
    This weblog documents the development: proposal, technical tests, film reviews, reading notes,
    shoot days and a final reflection. It was made for CIN506 Experimental Film and Animation at Ulster University.
  </p>
  <p class="meta">All metrics, interfaces and data shown in the film and on this site are fabricated. No real clients, chats or analytics appear.</p>
</Base>
